#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Ukudalwa kwemiphumela engaphambili kubala kusengaphambili imiphumela yeSihlungi engxenyeni ngayinye yethrafikhi, i-NAT ivuliwe futhi ivaliwe, bese kuyigcina kunqolobane ye-Parallel Query, ukuze imibiko yedatha endala ivuleke ngokushesha.  Izingxenye ezintsha zidalwa imiphumela engaphambili ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ziyeka ukuthola ithrafikhi.  Okudingekayo kusho ukuthi izingxenye ezishintshiwe azikabi namiphumela edalwe ngaphambili, Okusebenzayo kusho ukuthi ukudalwa kwemiphumela engaphambili kuyaqhubeka, futhi Okusesikhathini kusho ukuthi zonke izingxenye ezishintshiwe sezidalwe imiphumela engaphambili.  Okusebenzayo: N kuyinani lemibuzo yeSihlungi esebenzayo njengamanje.  Ingxenye esathola ithrafikhi ayidalwa imiphumela engaphambili, ngakho ayibalwa."

