#: setup.php
msgid "Many Big Tech data collection services like to mask their ownership of domains to obfuscate the fact that they are collecting your personal information.  If you are concerned with this and your Cacti install has access to the Internet, you can use Arin to remove the mask from those Big Tech companies."
msgstr "Izinsizakalo eziningi zokuqoqa idatha ze-Big Tech zithanda ukufihla ubunikazi bazo bezizinda ukuze zifihle iqiniso lokuthi ziqoqa ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu. Uma ukhathazekile ngalokhu futhi ukufakwa kwakho kwe-Cacti kunokufinyelela ku-Inthanethi, ungasebenzisa i-Arin ukususa leso sembozo kulezo zinkampani ze-Big Tech."

