#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Imibuzo Ehambisanayo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "Ingemuva Lemibuzo Ehambisanayo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Khetha ukuthi imibuzo ye-FlowView ehambisanayo yenziwa kanjani. I-Legacy PHP Runner ihlukanisa inqubo ye-flowview_runner.php ngombuzo ngamunye nange-shard ngayinye. I-FlowView Query Service ithumela umsebenzi ofanayo we-map-reduce kusevisi ye-Go esebenza isikhathi eside nge-localhost, igwema ukulibaziseka kokuqaliswa kwenqubo ngombuzo ngamunye nokuqoqwa kwedathabheyisi. Idinga ukuthi isevisi ye-flowview-query (bheka i-plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) ifakwe futhi isebenze."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Isigijimi se-PHP Esidala"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Isevisi Yemibuzo Ye-FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "I-URL Yesevisi Yombuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "I-URL eyisisekelo ye-FlowView Query Service, isibonelo http://127.0.0.1:8699. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze uthole ngokuzenzakalelayo imbobo yesikhashana efayeleni lembobo yesevisi."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Ifayela Lechweba Lesevisi Yombuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Indlela eya efayeleni lechweba lapho Isevisi Yemibuzo ye-FlowView ibhala khona ikheli layo eliboshiwe.  Isetshenziselwa ukuthola indawo yokugcina yesevisi lapho i-URL Yesevisi Yemibuzo engenhla ingenalutho."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Ithokheni Yesevisi Yombuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Imfihlo eyabiwe ongayikhetha.  Uma isethiwe, i-Cacti iyithumela ku-FlowView Query Service njengeheda ye-\"Authorization: Bearer\" futhi isevisi iyenqaba noma yisiphi isicelo esishintsha isimo esingethuli ithokheni efanayo.  Setha inani elifanayo kufayela lokulungiselela lesevisi (auth_token) noma kokuguquguqukayo kwendawo okuthi FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN.  Kunconywa noma nini lapho isevisi ifinyeleleka yinoma yini engeyona izinqubo zasendaweni ezithenjwayo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Izintambo Ezisebenza Kanyekanye Eziphezulu"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu lemicu ezothunyelwa ukusebenzisa imibuzo ye-FlowView. Qaphela ukuthi ungaba nomucu ongu-1 kuphela ngokwahlukaniswa kwedathabheyisi ngakunye, futhi kufanele uqaphele ukuthi ungagcwalisi iseva yakho yedathabheyisi ngokuba nemicu eminingi kakhulu esebenza kanyekanye."

